## Model card

- **Claimed name:** Agnes 3.0 Flash (folder slug `agnes-3.0-flash`, id `agnes-ai/agnes-3.0-flash`). Agnes AI proprietary high-throughput agentic text model with 512K context, 65,536 max output, text + image in / text out; tool calling, thinking mode; $0.05/$0.15 per 1M.
